  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with multi-profile and avgpool aggregation (config_005) achieves high performance. This experiment tests combining this RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder in a multimodal setup, using avgpool (proven effective in RNA-only) and concat fusion. It isolates the impact of adding image data to a strong RNA-only baseline, addressing uncertainty about multimodal benefits while reusing effective components."
}

